DTEND:20260725T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260725T000000Z
SUMMARY:Slow Yoga with Lea Peace
DESCRIPTION:With Lea Peace.\n\nShe is going to perform a peaceful\, 
 contemplative yoga practice. The patrons will be able to discover the world 
 of breathing control and concentration while seated in chairs. In 
 addition\, they will be able to see the range of motion in their joints\, 
 strengthen their core muscles through these activities\, and\, finally\, 
 stand up and balance for a little while.\n\nAbout the presenter.\n\nLea 
 Peace is a member of the gender-inclusive Empty Cloud Monastery in West 
 Orange. She has been practicing for a long time and has been certified by 
 the Kripalu Center for Yoga and Health in MA.\n\n
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
UID:LibCal-10341-17021157
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17021157
